# Scenario 'browser_errors': browser error paths. Connects to the fake site, then follows the first link of the index page (DOWN, A) once per
# fault, changing the fake Internet at run time with the `net` directive (deterministic, recorded in inputs/browser_errors.txt):
# HTTP 500, truncated body (Content-Length larger than the data), body without Content-Length, 302 redirect, DNS NXDOMAIN, DNS timeout (no answer),
# TCP connect refused, TCP reset during the transfer, adapter unplugged during a page load (then plugged in again). Each fault ends with the error
# dialog dismissed by A / the page shown. Starts from the state left by 'browser_pages'. Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A                        # title -> top menu
waitstable 60 max 600
tap RIGHT
wait 40
tap A                        # ホームページ (prompt)
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A                        # ホームページ
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A                        # password screen
waitstable 60 max 900
tap A
waitstable 60 max 900
wait 1200
shot index
# --- http500
net http_status=500
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
wait 900
shot http500
tap A
wait 500
shot http500_after
# --- http_trunc
net http_status=0
net http_trunc=100
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
wait 900
shot http_trunc
tap A
wait 500
shot http_trunc_after
# --- http_nolen
net http_trunc=-1
net http_nolen=1
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
wait 900
shot http_nolen
tap B
wait 500
shot http_nolen_after
# --- http_redirect
net http_nolen=0
net http_redirect=1
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
wait 900
shot http_redirect
tap B
wait 500
shot http_redirect_after
# --- dns_nx
net http_redirect=0
net dns=nx
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
wait 900
shot dns_nx
tap A
wait 500
shot dns_nx_after
# --- dns_drop
net dns=drop
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
wait 5000
shot dns_drop
tap A
wait 500
shot dns_drop_after
# --- tcp_refuse
net dns=ok
net tcp=refuse
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
wait 900
shot tcp_refuse
tap A
wait 500
shot tcp_refuse_after
# --- tcp_reset
net tcp=reset
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
wait 900
shot tcp_reset
tap A
wait 500
shot tcp_reset_after
# --- adapter unplugged during a page load, plugged in again afterwards
net tcp=ok
tap DOWN
wait 30
tap A
wait 20
unplug
wait 3000
shot unplugged
tap A
wait 600
shot unplugged_after
plug
wait 1200
shot plugged
tap A
wait 900
shot plugged_after
tap B
wait 600
shot end
